/*
 *
 * Implements semantic verification for class methods, focusing on:
 *   - direct method collisions between classes and their ancestors,
 *   - override legality(return types, protection, final, field-method rules),
 *   - trait-based override constraints,
 *   - thrower compatibility,
 *   - method signature similarity checks.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::symbol::class_::method::verif
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/symbol/class_/method/verif.yr
 * @Author(s):
